			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add IFileSystemService interface export\n\nAdd a new interface file at Source/Interfaces/IFileSystemService.ts that re-exports the IFileSystemService from the Services module. This provides a clean interface module location for file system operations.\n\nThe Target/ directory contains the compiled JavaScript output from this TypeScript interface file.",
			"SHA": "f754402bf7ff1703e44ede5f08a804cb063b2674"
