			"Date": "2026-04-11T12:58:24Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				278,
				2
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Add ESBuild and Mountain configuration files\n\nAdd two new configuration files to the Cocoon element's Target/Source/Configuration directory:\n\n- ESBuild/Cocoon.js (731 bytes) - ESBuild configuration for building Cocoon extension host\n- MountainConfig.js (3468 bytes) - Configuration for Mountain backend integration\n\nThese configuration files enable the build pipeline to properly compile and bundle the Cocoon extension host while establishing the connection configuration for Mountain backend communication.",
			"SHA": "019880dc6ae669e787387cfcbe936fa79c24fc91"
		}
